Ah, they said to replace both.

1508
01:40:50,169 --> 01:40:51,209
3、4、
3, 4,

1509
01:40:51,269 --> 01:40:53,469
両方、5、6、7、8、9、10、
both, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10,

1510
