Oh, right, let me touch the bed.

1520
01:41:07,579 --> 01:41:08,739
ベッド触っといて。
Just make sure to touch the bed.

1521
01:41:10,219 --> 01:41:11,399
ベッド触っといて。
Make sure to touch the bed.

1522
01:41:14,819 --> 01:41:16,649
ドアが、ドアが綺麗になってる！
The door, the door looks so clean!

1523
01:41:16,979 --> 01:41:18,419
