外に出やすいね。
it's easy to get outside.

1551
01:42:16,799 --> 01:42:17,549
うん、冒険に行きやすい。
Yeah, easy to head out for adventures.

1552
01:42:18,079 --> 01:42:18,399
いいね。
Nice.

1553
01:42:18,899 --> 01:42:19,849
金床とか。
Anvils and stuff.

1554
01:42:22,209 --> 01:42:22,729
よいしょ。
There we go.

1555
