え、すごい！丸石焼いたらツルツルになったのじゃ！知らなかった！
Whoa, awesome! When you smelt cobblestone, it gets all smooth! I didn't know that!

1601
01:44:11,399 --> 01:44:12,359
え！すごい！
What! Amazing!

1602
01:44:12,949 --> 01:44:14,789
今石焼いてるから待っててね、おのしろ。
I'm smelting stone right now, so wait a sec, Onoshiro.

1603
01:44:17,549 --> 01:44:19,079
木炭のが作れっぽ…
Looks like charcoal makes...

1604
01:44:20,359 --> 01:44:21,079
すごい！
Amazing!

1605
01:44:21,259 --> 01:44:21,889
知らなかった！
I had no idea!

1606
01:44:25,759 --> 01:44:27,959
きっといらないから焼く。
I probably don't need it, so I'll smelt it.

1607
01:44:32,569 --> 01:44:33,569
できた！
I did it!

1608
01:44:33,889 --> 01:44:34,569
石切台！
A stonecutter!

1609
01:44:35,199 --> 01:44:35,999
石切！
Stonecutter!

1610
01:44:36,169 --> 01:44:37,639
ねえねえねえ、なんかさ、
Hey hey hey, you know,

1611
