お前やばい。
You're dangerous.

1837
01:54:18,995 --> 01:54:20,535
お前やばい。
You're dangerous.

1838
01:54:20,635 --> 01:54:21,235
ここならえい。
Here, take this!

1839
01:54:21,895 --> 01:54:22,635
よいしょ。
There we go.

1840
01:54:23,275 --> 01:54:24,215
よいしょ。
There we go.

1841
