Hey hey, Sopia, Sopia! Listen, I thought of something amazing.

1906
01:59:19,681 --> 01:59:30,481
あのさ、遊びまわり隊のさ、おうち、住居全部さ、あの、壁全部さ、ガラス？ガラスで作ったら神じゃない？
You know, for Asobi Mawaritai's house, our residence, what if, like, all the walls are made of glass? Wouldn't that be god-tier?

1907
