I want to consult about how much we can make today.

1932
02:00:52,221 --> 02:00:52,811
ねえ。
Right.

1933
02:00:53,271 --> 02:01:00,871
え、ちょっとワンチャン指、あの、なんか、それか遠隔で電話して相談すんのでもいいし。
Eh, maybe we can use our fingers, or, like, call remotely and consult.

1934
02:01:00,941 --> 02:01:01,621
確かにね。
True.

1935
