あとね、わしね、やりたいことあってね。
Also, you know, I have something I want to do.

1936
02:01:04,151 --> 02:01:09,311
あの、屋根の上に4方向あるじゃろ？1234。
Like, there are four directions on the roof, right? 1, 2, 3, 4.

1937
02:01:09,311 --> 02:01:13,431
